        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            505,
            329,
            573,
            468
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "知名问答平台 StackOverflow 的调查表明 , 自2015 年以来， Rust 一直是开发者最爱的编程语言。",
        "bbox": [
            617,
            346,
            988,
            455
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "nature ",
        "text_level": 3,
        "bbox": [
            495,
            555,
            601,
            607
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "《 Nature 》杂志 2020 年尾的文章《 WhyScientists are Turning to Rust 》中也强调科学家极为推崇 Rust 。",
        "bbox": [
            614,
            509,
            983,
            651
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "华为是五位",
